:''Not to be confused with [[Metal Maiden Koneko (Uber Rare Cat)|Metal Maiden Koneko]].''
'''Koneko''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Best of the Best Milestone Edition (Gacha Event)|Best of the Best Milestone Edition]] gacha event. She was added in [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]].

